    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "block",
   "text": "Democrats tried to block him. They argued he had not been a citizen for nine years, pointing to the Dred Scott decision.",
   "section": "cost",
   "visual": {
    "kind": "title",
    "title": "Blocked",
    "sub": "by Senate Democrats"
